{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12392","headline":"新丰主人 · 钱起","name":"新丰主人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"明代少知己，夜光频暗投。\n迍邅终薄命，动息尽穷愁。\n自欲归飞鷁，当爲不系舟。\n双垂素丝泪，几弊皁貂裘。\n暮鸟栖幽树，孤云出旧丘。\n蛩悲衣褐夕，雨暗转蓬秋。\n客里冯谖劒，歌中甯戚牛。\n主人能纵酒，一醉且忘忧。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12392.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12392","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}